      "side": 1,
      "message": "I\u0027m confused by the scope of this CL. I thought it was supposed to incorporate CL:6796691, which removes this timer set/check and adds a replacement one in `tc_unattached_src_run`. The result was that when transitioning from Unattached.SNK or Unattached.SRC to DRPAutoToggle, only a single iteration of tDRP was applied.\n\nThis CL appears to add the delay to Unattached.SRC (among other things), but at least superficially, it leaves the redundant delay in DRPAutoToggle. then, it adds the below \"fast path\" exception that I don\u0027t fully understand yet.\n\nWas the timer change in the previous CL incorrect? If so, can you explain at a high level the timer change intended in this CL?",
