      "writtenOn": "2025-09-04T16:52:46Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Sorry for confusion \u0026 Thanks for raising this. The timer change in CL:6796691 was correct — the intent is that only a single tDRP in Unattached.SRC is needed, Now In this CL I’ve adjusted the implementation so that tDRP is limited to Unattached.SRC tied to the drp_sw_toggle_count logic and removed both the redundant tDRP in DRP_AUTO_TOGGLE and the experimental fast path. Those additions were only used while debugging TD.4.6.5/4.6.6 timing issues may be not required for spec alignment.\n\nWith the current change, TD.4.6.2 passes consistently. TD.4.6.6, however, only passes if an extra tDRP is also present in DRP_AUTO_TOGGLE. Since that looks like a compliance quirk, I plan to keep the scope clean here and handle further investigation/cleanup in a follow-up CL. The debounce and software toggle counter changes remain here.",
